2.0.2

The app version the pictures in this folder show.

One line, in one file, because the README used to carry it in prose beside the version
of every earlier retake -- 1.1.65 split the first launch into three screens, 1.1.67 gave
the app its wallet icon, 1.1.82 redrew the six -- and a reader could not tell which of
those numbers was the answer and which was the history.

check.js reads it. Rewrite it in the same commit that replaces the pictures, never on
its own: the file is a claim about what is in the folder, and a number nobody re-took
anything for is worse than no number.

Since site v2.18.0 the pictures are the app's own gallery: the screens drawn off the JVM
by the app's GalleryTest (app/build/reports/contrast) from the v2.0.2 release commit, in
the Yellow accent, scaled from 1078 to 780 wide (780x1736). Scenes: 03-01-Home,
05-Transactions, 07-Accounts-All, 09-Loans-Given, 06-Analytics, 11-Backups-On, and for
step 4 01-02-Welcome-Name-Typed, 01-04-Create-PIN, 01-05-Confirm-PIN. Home, Accounts and
Loans have Bangla renders; the other -bn files are copies of the English ones. The
gallery's sample ledger is not the owner's.
